<title>FRANCE: RP Rorer sells Fisons French unit. [CORRECTED 00:11 GMT 2/10]</title>
<headline>RP Rorer sells Fisons French unit. [CORRECTED 00:11 GMT 2/10]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. pharmaceuticals firm Rhone-Poulenc Rorer has sold its French unit Fisons Scac Fisons SA to management, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Corrects name of unit being sold from Fisons SA).</p>
<p>The Scac Fisons SA unit has annual turnover of 100 million francs and was a wholly-owned subsidiary of the British Fison Plc company which was merged with Rorer in 1995 after it was taken over by Rorer.</p>
<p>No financial details were given.</p>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc Rorer is a unit of Rhone-Poulenc</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
